804
00:36:38,230 --> 00:36:39,339
The room is so nice.

805
00:36:39,340 --> 00:36:40,370
Okay.

806
00:36:41,900 --> 00:36:43,369
Oh, it's nice and cool.

807
00:36:43,370 --> 00:36:44,670
