824
00:37:20,790 --> 00:37:22,079
It's so clean.

825
00:37:22,080 --> 00:37:24,020
(You can just open up the curtains and jump right into the pool.)

826
00:37:24,210 --> 00:37:27,179
(1st floor, front floor, sofa, dining room, bedroom, pool)

827
00:37:27,180 --> 00:37:28,950
