830
00:37:33,690 --> 00:37:34,770
Okay.

831
00:37:37,270 --> 00:37:38,999
Oh, my. They're all main rooms.

832
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:40,270
It's so spacious.

833
00:37:40,430 --> 00:37:41,900
They're all main rooms.

834
00:37:43,930 --> 00:37:46,310
Several people could stay here.

835
00:37:46,370 --> 00:37:49,310
They all have TVs, double beds, and showers.

836
00:37:49,370 --> 00:37:52,080
