837
00:37:52,270 --> 00:37:53,579
What? There's even a third floor?

838
00:37:53,580 --> 00:37:55,909
No way. Oh, my. It's even bigger.

839
00:37:55,910 --> 00:37:57,850
(On the 3rd floor is the biggest room!)

840
00:37:58,450 --> 00:37:59,789
Five couples could stay here together.

841
00:37:59,790 --> 00:38:00,790
Ten people could stay here.

842
00:38:00,790 --> 00:38:01,790
