As fast as you can. This is no joke, right?

868
00:39:14,330 --> 00:39:16,039
Keep going. Quickly.

869
00:39:16,040 --> 00:39:18,430
Higher up to the sky.

870
00:39:18,590 --> 00:39:20,899
- To the sky. Oh, hold on.
- Oh, gosh!

871
00:39:20,900 --> 00:39:22,199
(Hyun Moo finally exploded.)

872
00:39:22,200 --> 00:39:23,539
- Oh, that hurts.
- Oh, that hurts.

873
00:39:23,540 --> 00:39:24,700
(Hyun Moo finally exploded.)

874
00:39:25,100 --> 00:39:26,900
- That's so irritating.
- It is, right?

875
00:39:27,640 --> 00:39:29,739
