897
00:40:17,950 --> 00:40:19,160
- Hello.
- Hello.

898
00:40:20,160 --> 00:40:21,270
This is nice.

899
00:40:23,270 --> 00:40:25,329
Let's eat and think about what to do.

900
00:40:25,330 --> 00:40:26,330
Okay.

901
00:40:26,331 --> 00:40:28,630
