943
00:42:19,940 --> 00:42:21,409
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

944
00:42:21,410 --> 00:42:22,850
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

945
00:42:24,480 --> 00:42:25,790
There's no traffic light.

946
