992
00:44:03,250 --> 00:44:04,450
This place...

993
00:44:05,080 --> 00:44:06,449
- This place is great too.
- This place is nice too.

994
00:44:06,450 --> 00:44:07,849
This place is so pretty.

995
00:44:07,850 --> 00:44:08,980
It's so pretty.

996
00:44:10,750 --> 00:44:12,619
I love this.

997
00:44:12,620 --> 00:44:14,520
