- Mì Quảng?

1053
00:46:34,460 --> 00:46:35,530
Mì Hải Sản?

1054
00:46:37,870 --> 00:46:38,970
Mì Quảng?

1055
00:46:40,240 --> 00:46:41,270
Mì Quảng?

1056
00:46:41,400 --> 00:46:43,839
Mì Quảng with shrimp, meat, and eggs?

1057
00:46:43,840 --> 00:46:44,840
Yes. One.

1058
00:46:44,841 --> 00:46:47,079
Mì Hải Sản...

1059
00:46:47,080 --> 00:46:48,610
(Don't go.)

1060
00:46:48,810 --> 00:46:51,110
(Is this right?)

1061
00:46:51,450 --> 00:46:53,550
(Nodding?)

1062
00:46:53,650 --> 00:46:54,719
Mì Quảng...

1063
00:46:54,720 --> 00:46:55,779
(They're not sure if they ordered correctly.)

1064
00:46:55,780 --> 00:46:58,090
- Our communication...
- We can't...

1065
00:46:58,150 --> 00:46:59,319
communicate with them at all.

1066
00:46:59,320 --> 00:47:01,660
(We can't communicate with them at all.)

1067
00:47:02,360 --> 00:47:03,659
Oh, goodness.

1068
00:47:03,660 --> 00:47:04,830
(The downside of local spots, Communication isn't smooth.)

1069
00:47:04,930 --> 00:47:06,229
We could really get to know this country...

1070
00:47:06,230 --> 00:47:08,100
- if we spoke the language.
- Seriously.

1071
00:47:08,800 --> 00:47:11,669
- They're kind of like Koreans.
- They are. Their food too.

1072
00:47:11,670 --> 00:47:12,940
Is that Mì Quảng back there?

1073
00:47:13,770 --> 00:47:15,700
- Mì Quảng?
- Mì Quảng?

1074
00:47:16,640 --> 00:47:17,909
- It's Mì Quảng.
- He says it's Mì Quảng.

1075
00:47:17,910 --> 00:47:19,069
- He says it is.
- Mì Quảng.

1076
00:47:19,070 --> 00:47:20,379
That... Mì Quảng. This one.

1077
00:47:20,380 --> 00:47:21,480
- Mì Quảng?
- Yes.

1078
00:47:21,580 --> 00:47:22,739
Oh, Mì Quảng. This one.

1079
00:47:22,740 --> 00:47:23,849
(They really want to eat Mì Quảng.)

1080
00:47:23,850 --> 00:47:25,680
We want this one here. Mì Quảng.

1081
00:47:26,280 --> 00:47:27,449
(All they know how to say is Mì Quảng.)

1082
00:47:27,450 --> 00:47:28,850
- Okay. Mì Quảng.
- Mì Quảng

1083
00:47:31,720 --> 00:47:32,750
Mì Quảng...

1084
00:47:33,260 --> 00:47:36,790
(Curious what Mì Quảng is like)

1085
00:47:38,130 --> 00:47:41,230
Okay. Mì Quảng is a saucy rice noodle dish...

1086
00:47:41,830 --> 00:47:44,769
that's popular in Tỉnh Quảng Nam and Da Nang,

1087
00:47:44,770 --> 00:47:47,300
the central region of Vietnam.

1088
00:47:49,540 --> 00:47:53,239
Mì Quảng is a famous local dish from Vietnam's central region.

1089
00:47:53,240 --> 00:47:57,110
Unlike regular rice noodles, Mì Quảng doesn't have much broth.

1090
00:47:57,310 --> 00:47:59,579
It's made with deep rich bone broth, boiled for a long time.

1091
00:47:59,580 --> 00:48:03,920
Each restaurant uses its own style and spices.

1092
00:48:04,850 --> 00:48:09,660
It's eaten with various toppings,

1093
00:48:09,890 --> 00:48:14,330
such as shrimp, pork, chicken, and beef.

1094
00:48:15,560 --> 00:48:18,769
(Mì Quảng, a popular Da Nang breakfast dish...)

1095
00:48:18,770 --> 00:48:22,540
(with wide noodles and simmered-down soup)

1096
00:48:26,040 --> 00:48:27,439
- Oh, Mì Quảng?
- Mì Quảng. Hải Sản.

1097
00:48:27,440 --> 00:48:28,579
- Hải Sản.
- Hải Sản.

1098
00:48:28,580 --> 00:48:29,610
Seafood.

1099
00:48:29,780 --> 00:48:31,249
(Mì Hải Sản, Meaning "seafood noodle dish" in Vietnamese)

1100
00:48:31,250 --> 00:48:34,020
(Stir-fried, served with broth, it's enjoyed in various ways.)

1101
00:48:34,480 --> 00:48:35,980
- Here's the Mì Quảng.
- Mì Quảng?

1102
00:48:36,690 --> 00:48:38,019
Mine has more seafood in it.

1103
00:48:38,020 --> 00:48:39,389
- Do you want to eat this?
- It doesn't matter to me.

1104
00:48:39,390 --> 00:48:40,689
- It doesn't matter to me.
- This looks good.

1105
00:48:40,690 --> 00:48:41,890
I like that it's served so quickly.

1106
00:48:42,820 --> 00:48:45,130
(Mì Hải Sản, Mì Quảng)

1107
00:48:45,660 --> 00:48:50,070
(Their first breakfast in Da Nang, 200 percent local-style)

1108
00:48:50,230 --> 00:48:52,000
Apparently, they also put frogs in here.

1109
00:48:52,100 --> 00:48:54,370
- Really?
- I think they love frogs here.

1110
00:48:55,300 --> 00:48:57,369
I mean, it's mostly protein.

1111
00:48:57,370 --> 00:48:58,410
Right.

1112
00:49:01,880 --> 00:49:03,079
(Getting excited while mixing the Mì Quảng)

1113
00:49:03,080 --> 00:49:05,310
I've never seen something like this before.

1114
00:49:05,480 --> 00:49:06,749
Is this a type of fish?

1115
00:49:06,750 --> 00:49:08,050
Oh, fish.

1116
00:49:18,630 --> 00:49:20,560
(The flavour makes him nod.)

1117
00:49:23,270 --> 00:49:25,369
(Highly satisfied)

1118
00:49:25,370 --> 00:49:26,400
It's clean-tasting.

1119
00:49:27,670 --> 00:49:28,840
It's nice and salty.

1120
00:49:30,740 --> 00:49:34,640
(The rich meat broth with the light shrimp flavour...)

1121
00:49:35,010 --> 00:49:38,610
(makes a perfect soup to mix the wide noodles into.)

1122
00:49:40,420 --> 00:49:44,750
(Joon starts his eating show.)

1123
00:49:44,850 --> 00:49:46,249
I like it. It's good.

1124
00:49:46,250 --> 00:49:47,759
(Furrowing his eyebrows from satisfaction)

1125
00:49:47,760 --> 00:49:48,820
It's good.

1126
00:49:49,520 --> 00:49:51,390
What? Rice puffs?

1127
00:49:52,630 --> 00:49:53,800
Oh, I see.

1128
00:49:55,160 --> 00:49:57,299
Okay. I saw they eat it this way.

1129
00:49:57,300 --> 00:49:58,929
(Local style, A snack to eat with Mì Quảng)

1130
00:49:58,930 --> 00:50:00,870
- Okay. I see.
- Okay.

1131
00:50:01,200 --> 00:50:02,300
- Chào em.
- Chào anh.

1132
00:50:03,710 --> 00:50:05,569
(Bánh tráng mè, A nutty and crunchy rice cracker to eat with Mì Quảng)

1133
00:50:05,570 --> 00:50:06,639
Put some of this.

1134
00:50:06,640 --> 00:50:08,480
(Bánh tráng mè, A nutty and crunchy rice cracker to eat with Mì Quảng)

1135
00:50:19,990 --> 00:50:21,559
Vietnam really is a great place to come and eat.

1136
00:50:21,560 --> 00:50:24,730
(Day 2 in Da Nang, He has fallen in love with Vietnamese food.)

1137
00:50:26,760 --> 00:50:29,259
I think this dish would be popular in Korea. Don't you think?

1138
00:50:29,260 --> 00:50:30,370
- Definitely.
- Just as it is.

1139
00:50:31,470 --> 00:50:33,469
It's not too unfamiliar.

1140
00:50:33,470 --> 00:50:34,470
Right.

1141
00:50:34,970 --> 00:50:38,110
(Crunchy)

1142
00:50:40,340 --> 00:50:41,439
(Hyun Moo adds a spoonful of spice.)

1143
00:50:41,440 --> 00:50:43,210
- It's perfect right now.
- I like spicy food.

1144
00:50:56,430 --> 00:50:58,060
If you can't handle spice, you can't eat this.

1145
00:50:58,230 --> 00:50:59,900
I can handle spice. I like spicy food.

1146
00:51:00,230 --> 00:51:01,759
(Hyun Moo really likes the spicy sauce.)

1147
00:51:01,760 --> 00:51:03,370
This is sweet chilli, and this is chilli.

1148
00:51:06,700 --> 00:51:08,100
Oh, it's good.

1149
00:51:08,400 --> 00:51:09,939
I want to tell that dad yesterday...

1150
00:51:09,940 --> 00:51:11,070
(Thank you.)

1151
00:51:13,440 --> 00:51:14,909
- Should I try this?
- This?

1152
00:51:14,910 --> 00:51:16,879
(Curious about the spicy sauce after seeing Hyun Moo's reaction)

1153
00:51:16,880 --> 00:51:18,379
It might be too spicy for you. Are you sure?

1154
00:51:18,380 --> 00:51:19,920
Yes, I do like spicy food.

1155
00:51:21,850 --> 00:51:24,050
I can really handle spice,

1156
00:51:24,250 --> 00:51:25,420
but my stomach doesn't like it.

1157
00:51:30,760 --> 00:51:32,760
It's good, right? It's so good.

1158
00:51:32,960 --> 00:51:34,260
- I like it.
- Yes.

1159
00:51:34,730 --> 00:51:35,860
This is tasty.

1160
00:51:36,570 --> 00:51:39,300
(Very satisfied)

1161
00:51:42,970 --> 00:51:44,570
It's nice and warm too. It's perfect.

1162
00:51:44,970 --> 00:51:47,779
This is a spicy flavour that Korean people like.

1163
00:51:47,780 --> 00:51:49,339
- Right.
- It's not too strong.

1164
00:51:49,340 --> 00:51:50,810
It's spicy in a tasty way.

1165
00:51:51,210 --> 00:51:52,310
- Right?
- Yes.

1166
00:51:54,250 --> 00:51:55,680
I like cilantro.

1167
00:51:57,050 --> 00:51:58,250
Oh, Hyun Moo. This is...

1168
00:51:59,520 --> 00:52:00,889
- a bit too much.
- What?

1169
00:52:00,890 --> 00:52:02,060
Why are you adding so much?

1170
00:52:02,120 --> 00:52:05,189
(There's more cilantro than noodles.)

1171
00:52:05,190 --> 00:52:06,360
I usually add this much.

1172
00:52:06,930 --> 00:52:08,160
I even eat the roots.

1173
00:52:08,600 --> 00:52:09,870
- Really?
- Look.

1174
00:52:11,170 --> 00:52:13,240
(Even the locals are fascinated.)

1175
00:52:13,540 --> 00:52:14,800
- Cilantro...
- Yes?

1176
00:52:15,740 --> 00:52:18,170
- actually helps with digestion.
- Yes?

1177
00:52:18,470 --> 00:52:19,569
I see.

1178
00:52:19,570 --> 00:52:21,709
(Copying Hyun Moo and adding lots of cilantro)

1179
00:52:21,710 --> 00:52:22,839
I don't eat it for no reason.

1180
00:52:22,840 --> 00:52:25,080
- I want to try it like you.
- It's tasty.

1181
00:52:25,380 --> 00:52:27,219
- Let's try everything.
- Like this?

1182
00:52:27,220 --> 00:52:28,250
(Cilantro party)

1183
00:52:37,460 --> 00:52:39,459
(Moved)

1184
00:52:39,460 --> 00:52:40,529
It's pretty nice.

1185
00:52:40,530 --> 00:52:43,930
(It's day two of the trip, and they're already growing close.)

1186
00:52:45,170 --> 00:52:47,900
Except for the market yesterday,

1187
00:52:48,340 --> 00:52:49,640
this is our first real meal here.

1188
00:52:50,040 --> 00:52:51,770
- It's delicious.
- I like this place much better.

1189
00:52:52,010 --> 00:52:53,580
This place is really nice.

1190
00:52:55,710 --> 00:52:59,080
Actually, yesterday, the man...

1191
00:53:01,350 --> 00:53:03,179
said it was a thicker soup.

1192
00:53:03,180 --> 00:53:05,490
That's not really my style. I'm not a saucy noodle guy.

1193
00:53:05,790 --> 00:53:07,720
I like drinking lots of broth.

1194
00:53:08,560 --> 00:53:10,660
But this is making me forget the rice noodles I normally like.

1195
00:53:11,530 --> 00:53:14,099
These are the most unique and delicious rice noodles...

1196
00:53:14,100 --> 00:53:16,830
I think I've ever tried.

1197
00:53:17,770 --> 00:53:19,099
Getting recommendations from locals...

1198
00:53:19,100 --> 00:53:20,440
is always the best.

1199
00:53:20,900 --> 00:53:22,439
You can't search this place from Korea.

1200
00:53:22,440 --> 00:53:23,469
Exactly.

1201
00:53:23,470 --> 00:53:25,270
(Agreed)

1202
00:53:30,810 --> 00:53:33,820
(They finished eating at the same time.)

1203
00:53:37,250 --> 00:53:38,950
You eat at a similar speed as me.

1204
00:53:40,190 --> 00:53:41,259
That's interesting.

1205
00:53:41,260 --> 00:53:43,560
- I knock things back quickly.
- I do too.

1206
00:53:44,530 --> 00:53:46,359
That's so interesting. We finished at the same time.

1207
00:53:46,360 --> 00:53:48,599
(They're even similar on how fast they eat.)

1208
00:53:48,600 --> 00:53:49,930
I've never experienced this before.

1209
00:53:50,470 --> 00:53:51,870
- Oh, my. That's funny.
- I eat fast.

1210
00:53:53,770 --> 00:53:56,070
Everything is perfect so far.

1211
00:53:56,470 --> 00:53:57,710
And we didn't plan anything.

1212
00:53:59,640 --> 00:54:01,209
This is a nice place. I'm going to save it.

1213
00:54:01,210 --> 00:54:02,480
(Their first breakfast in Da Nang was a success.)

1214
00:54:04,180 --> 00:54:06,150
- What should we do now?
- What should we do?

1215
00:54:06,620 --> 00:54:09,650
Do you want to go there? That coffee place we saw earlier?

1216
00:54:10,120 --> 00:54:11,550
- Sure.
- For a dessert?

1217
00:54:11,750 --> 00:54:13,419
We have to have dessert. Do you remember where it was?

1218
00:54:13,420 --> 00:54:15,190
- I know where it is.
- I'm bad with directions.

1219
00:54:16,090 --> 00:54:17,190
How much is it?

1220
00:54:18,390 --> 00:54:20,459
It's 60,000 dong. Take off a zero...

1221
00:54:20,460 --> 00:54:22,759
- So 6,000, then it's 3 - It's only 3 dollars.

1222
00:54:22,760 --> 00:54:23,769
(One bowl of Mì Quảng, 25,000 dong, One bowl of Mì Hải Sản, 35,000 dong)

1223
00:54:23,770 --> 00:54:24,870
That's amazing!

1224
00:54:25,900 --> 00:54:26,969
It's three dollars for two?

1225
00:54:26,970 --> 00:54:28,040
It's really cheap.

1226
00:54:29,040 --> 00:54:32,569
(They're once again surprised by how cheap things are in Vietnam.)

1227
00:54:32,570 --> 00:54:33,680
Goodness.

1228
00:54:34,140 --> 00:54:35,609
How nice.

1229
00:54:35,610 --> 00:54:36,879
(Vietnamese noodles. I only thought of pho,)

1230
00:54:36,880 --> 00:54:38,149
(so it was a pleasant surprise.)

1231
00:54:38,150 --> 00:54:39,850
(Mì Quảng is a funny name, but it tastes amazing.)

1232
00:54:40,220 --> 00:54:43,120
These are all residential houses.

1233
00:54:44,290 --> 00:54:45,520
They're all residential houses. Look.

1234
00:54:46,050 --> 00:54:47,690
Since it's a hot day,

1235
00:54:48,090 --> 00:54:50,289
they came out for a bit to rest in between work.

1236
00:54:50,290 --> 00:54:51,529
(To escape the intense heat,)

1237
00:54:51,530 --> 00:54:54,059
The weather here makes you feel sluggish.

1238
00:54:54,060 --> 00:54:55,759
(a culture of taking a midday break emerged.)

1239
00:54:55,760 --> 00:54:56,900
It's so hot.

1240
00:54:58,400 --> 00:55:00,099
You remember the coffee place we saw earlier, right?

1241
00:55:00,100 --> 00:55:01,570
I do. We'll take a left here.

1242
00:55:03,940 --> 00:55:05,269
It's right there.

1243
00:55:05,270 --> 00:55:06,410
(Following the same route they took to the restaurant)

1244
00:55:07,410 --> 00:55:08,680
This is life.

1245
00:55:09,740 --> 00:55:11,549
Getting a cup of coffee while leaning on the wall.

1246
00:55:11,550 --> 00:55:12,679
(Vietnam's beloved sidewalk cafe culture)

1247
00:55:12,680 --> 00:55:14,279
It's a long cafe.

1248
00:55:14,280 --> 00:55:15,420
- Right.
- It's attached.

1249
00:55:15,920 --> 00:55:17,749
This would be so nice because of the nice sun.

1250
00:55:17,750 --> 00:55:20,120
This is really magical.

1251
00:55:22,460 --> 00:55:23,890
- Hi.
- Hi.

1252
00:55:24,060 --> 00:55:25,160
The menu...

1253
00:55:25,730 --> 00:55:27,100
I'll get orange juice.

1254
00:55:27,230 --> 00:55:29,130
- What?
- I can't take caffeine.

1255
00:55:30,030 --> 00:55:31,829
You're getting juice at a cafe?

1256
00:55:31,830 --> 00:55:32,900
I usually do that.

1257
00:55:33,130 --> 00:55:34,139
(The owner recommends refreshing lemon juice)

1258
00:55:34,140 --> 00:55:35,569
What would you like? Lemon?

1259
00:55:35,570 --> 00:55:36,739
Yes.

1260
00:55:36,740 --> 00:55:38,039
- Lemon?
- Lemon.

1261
00:55:38,040 --> 00:55:39,839
Lemon juice, and for me...

1262
00:55:39,840 --> 00:55:41,809
- Bạc xỉu.
- Bạc xỉu.

1263
00:55:41,810 --> 00:55:43,080
- Okay.
- Bạc xỉu.

1264
00:55:43,810 --> 00:55:44,980
Bạc xỉu.

1265
00:55:45,180 --> 00:55:46,349
Bạc xỉu...

1266
00:55:46,350 --> 00:55:49,249
is Vietnamese white coffee. That's Bạc xỉu.

1267
00:55:49,250 --> 00:55:51,249
- It's the traditional coffee.
- Yes.

1268
00:55:51,250 --> 00:55:52,619
(Vietnam's signature sweet coffee with condensed milk and milk)

1269
00:55:52,620 --> 00:55:54,320
Let's drink a cup of coffee...

1270
00:55:54,760 --> 00:55:56,020
and decide what to do today.

1271
00:55:57,060 --> 00:55:58,190
They're bringing it to us.

1272
00:56:00,530 --> 00:56:01,929
- Chào.
- Chào anh.

1273
00:56:01,930 --> 00:56:03,800
(Greeting for the nth time)

1274
00:56:04,030 --> 00:56:05,869
- Lemon.
- Lemon juice?

1275
00:56:05,870 --> 00:56:08,100
- Trà đá.
- Trà đá?

1276
00:56:08,270 --> 00:56:09,370
Try it.

1277
00:56:11,370 --> 00:56:12,440
(It's not salty.)

1278
00:56:12,970 --> 00:56:13,980
Mine?

1279
00:56:14,340 --> 00:56:15,579
Here?

1280
00:56:15,580 --> 00:56:17,110
- Together? Okay.
- Do we mix them?

1281
00:56:17,480 --> 00:56:18,610
Mix.

1282
00:56:19,050 --> 00:56:22,249
No. Drink them separately.

1283
00:56:22,250 --> 00:56:23,620
Drink this,

1284
00:56:24,190 --> 00:56:25,290
and then drink this.

1285
00:56:25,850 --> 00:56:27,589
(A refreshing tea consumed almost like water in Vietnam)

1286
00:56:27,590 --> 00:56:29,190
(It is often served with coffee as a palate cleanser.)

1287
00:56:29,260 --> 00:56:32,190
(There's trà đá here and there.)

1288
00:56:32,460 --> 00:56:33,760
I need to drink all of them.

1289
00:56:34,700 --> 00:56:35,860
What does it matter?

1290
00:56:36,300 --> 00:56:37,870
- Right.
- That doesn't matter.

1291
00:56:38,900 --> 00:56:41,440
It's really tasty.

1292
00:56:41,770 --> 00:56:44,040
This is really good.

1293
00:56:44,640 --> 00:56:45,740
It's just what I like.

1294
00:56:46,440 --> 00:56:47,840
(Frowning)

1295
00:56:48,180 --> 00:56:49,239
- Is it sour?
- It's sour.

1296
00:56:49,240 --> 00:56:51,249
- I love it.
- You like healthy things.

1297
00:56:51,250 --> 00:56:53,410
(I like it.)

1298
00:56:53,780 --> 00:56:56,950
(He tries to shake off the taste with bạc xỉu.)

1299
00:57:04,290 --> 00:57:05,430
Right.

1300
00:57:05,960 --> 00:57:10,500
(Taking a relaxing sip with nothing on their minds)

1301
00:57:10,970 --> 00:57:12,530
The sound of motorcycles...

1302
00:57:14,670 --> 00:57:17,210
(They're getting familiar with the streets of Da Nang.)

1303
00:57:17,340 --> 00:57:21,140
(They've blended naturally into the local scenery.)

1304
00:57:24,980 --> 00:57:28,550
(Hyun Moo and Joon also take some rest.)

1305
00:57:28,980 --> 00:57:30,750
I always drink coffee when I come to Vietnam.

1306
00:57:31,790 --> 00:57:33,420
Vietnamese coffee...

1307
00:57:34,190 --> 00:57:35,590
tastes good in Vietnam.

1308
00:57:35,720 --> 00:57:36,930
- Really?
- We had it in Korea as well.

1309
00:57:37,490 --> 00:57:38,960
- It didn't taste the same?
- It didn't.

1310
00:57:39,390 --> 00:57:40,499
- I wonder why.
- You need to drink it...

1311
00:57:40,500 --> 00:57:41,559
in this kind of vibe.

1312
00:57:41,560 --> 00:57:42,630
On a hot day.

1313
00:57:43,630 --> 00:57:45,129
I really love it here.

1314
00:57:45,130 --> 00:57:47,500
(I really love it here.)

1315
00:57:47,740 --> 00:57:50,740
(I've got to take pictures of this place.)

1316
00:57:53,310 --> 00:57:55,780
(Hold on)

1317
00:57:56,410 --> 00:57:57,680
My phone is gone!

1318
00:57:58,650 --> 00:57:59,850
My phone is gone!

1319
00:58:00,880 --> 00:58:03,079
- Where's my phone?
- What are you talking about?

1320
00:58:03,080 --> 00:58:04,390
Seriously. I'm serious.

1321
00:58:04,590 --> 00:58:05,990
- What?
- Did you leave it behind?

1322
00:58:07,120 --> 00:58:08,190
Should I call your phone?

1323
00:58:08,290 --> 00:58:11,260
(At the Mì Quảng place?)

1324
00:58:11,360 --> 00:58:15,200
(Or at their accommodation?)

1325
00:58:15,630 --> 00:58:17,599
I never lose things.

1326
00:58:17,600 --> 00:58:20,130
(Hyun Moo tries calling his phone.)

1327
00:58:20,570 --> 00:58:21,570
You remember where it was, right?

1328
00:58:21,571 --> 00:58:22,770
Run.

1329
00:58:23,070 --> 00:58:25,070
- Run.
- Let me get one more sip.

1330
00:58:25,310 --> 00:58:27,010
It's right here!

1331
00:58:27,140 --> 00:58:30,010
(Suddenly feeling happy)

1332
00:58:30,210 --> 00:58:31,879
It's right here!

1333
00:58:31,880 --> 00:58:32,950
(It was right under his nose.)

1334
00:58:33,080 --> 00:58:35,980
(The site of the incident)

1335
00:58:36,250 --> 00:58:39,720
(Joon is very clumsy.)

1336
00:58:39,950 --> 00:58:41,690
I'm not lying.

1337
00:58:42,360 --> 00:58:43,520
I had no idea.

1338
00:58:43,930 --> 00:58:45,660
(Lifespan minus 10)

1339
00:58:46,860 --> 00:58:48,400
I just called. Why didn't it ring?

1340
00:58:48,900 --> 00:58:49,960
It's on silent mode.

1341
00:58:50,200 --> 00:58:53,070
How would you find it when it's on silent mode?

1342
00:58:53,230 --> 00:58:54,900
I never lose things.

1343
00:58:56,640 --> 00:58:57,910
I'm exhausted.

1344
00:58:58,770 --> 00:58:59,870
Already?

1345
00:59:00,070 --> 00:59:02,210
- It's 10:20am.
- I'm sleepy.

1346
00:59:02,940 --> 00:59:04,350
What do you want to do?

1347
00:59:05,750 --> 00:59:07,420
Actually,

1348
00:59:07,620 --> 00:59:09,280
there's a place I was really curious about.

1349
00:59:10,650 --> 00:59:13,219
About 9 out of 10 people...

1350
00:59:13,220 --> 00:59:14,419
who come to Da Nang...

1351
00:59:14,420 --> 00:59:16,660
go to My Khe Beach.

1352
00:59:17,630 --> 00:59:21,430
(My Khe Beach)

1353
00:59:22,230 --> 00:59:25,430
It's a long beach.

1354
00:59:25,830 --> 00:59:27,270
If you go...

1355
00:59:27,700 --> 00:59:29,740
about five minutes away from My Khe Beach,

1356
00:59:29,840 --> 00:59:31,640
there's a beach called...

1357
00:59:33,210 --> 00:59:35,840
We can look for this there.

1358
00:59:37,310 --> 00:59:38,480
The yellow tree.

1359
00:59:38,780 --> 00:59:39,980
Really?

1360
00:59:40,210 --> 00:59:41,980
You rarely find Korean people there.

1361
00:59:42,750 --> 00:59:44,489
It's a hidden gem.

1362
00:59:44,490 --> 00:59:45,520
(A hidden beach in Da Nang with no Korean people)

1363
00:59:47,420 --> 00:59:53,590
(A different side of Da Nang awaits just around the corner.)

1364
00:59:54,000 --> 00:59:57,630
(There's a beach in this mysterious jungle?)

1365
00:59:57,900 --> 00:59:58,900
(Are you intruders?)

1366
00:59:59,270 --> 01:00:02,500
(Even the wild animals are wary of outsiders.)

1367
01:00:02,800 --> 01:00:05,710
(A beach only known to locals)

1368
01:00:07,010 --> 01:00:08,240
(Even if they get soaking wet,)

1369
01:00:08,680 --> 01:00:10,580
(they're just happy.)

1370
01:00:10,850 --> 01:00:14,020
(A beach only the locals used to enjoy)

1371
01:00:14,420 --> 01:00:15,550
Coconut juice?

1372
01:00:15,950 --> 01:00:20,150
(In search of a hidden gem of a getaway)

1373
01:00:21,160 --> 01:00:22,520
It was good.

1374
01:00:23,320 --> 01:00:24,460
I'm full.

1375
01:00:25,990 --> 01:00:28,560
- It's huge.
- It's amazing.

1376
01:00:28,960 --> 01:00:30,369
- Han River.
- Han.

1377
01:00:30,370 --> 01:00:32,100
- Han River?
- Han River.

1378
01:00:33,130 --> 01:00:35,970
Really? The size of it is also similar to ours.

1379
01:00:36,440 --> 01:00:37,739
It's the Dragon Bridge.

1380
01:00:37,740 --> 01:00:39,270
(A river that begins in Quảng Nam, flows through Da Nang,)

1381
01:00:39,670 --> 01:00:40,679
(and empties into the South China Sea)

1382
01:00:40,680 --> 01:00:42,640
Is this like the Hannam Bridge in Korea?

1383
01:00:43,080 --> 01:00:44,909
- Right.
- It's just the same.

1384
01:00:44,910 --> 01:00:48,450
(A giant dragon stretches along the river.)

1385
01:00:48,750 --> 01:00:50,950
(The Dragon Bridge, a landmark in Da Nang)

1386
01:00:51,090 --> 01:00:53,690
(A fire show that lights up the nights of Da Nang)

1387
01:00:53,890 --> 01:00:57,560
(They head east toward the sea.)

1388
01:00:59,230 --> 01:01:00,400
My Khe Beach?

1389
01:01:00,930 --> 01:01:02,199
This is My Khe Beach.

1390
01:01:02,200 --> 01:01:03,259
This is where...

1391
01:01:03,260 --> 01:01:04,300
- there are many Koreans?
- Yes.

1392
01:01:06,170 --> 01:01:07,700
So this is how I'm getting to see a beach.

1393
01:01:08,270 --> 01:01:09,270
Is this your first time seeing a beach?

1394
01:01:09,271 --> 01:01:10,840
- Yes.
- This year?

1395
01:01:20,450 --> 01:01:22,680
It's like Anmok Beach.

1396
01:01:22,920 --> 01:01:24,149
It's really nice.

1397
01:01:24,150 --> 01:01:27,260
(One of Da Nang's most beloved attractions)

1398
01:01:28,020 --> 01:01:29,760
(I like My Khe Beach.)

1399
01:01:29,960 --> 01:01:31,990
My Khe Beach is quite nice.

1400
01:01:33,090 --> 01:01:34,500
There's a reason why many people visit this place.

1401
01:01:35,160 --> 01:01:36,430
Do you see the Buddha statue there?

1402
01:01:36,830 --> 01:01:38,469
- At the far end.
- A Buddha statue?

1403
01:01:38,470 --> 01:01:40,869
The white one over there. That's famous too.

1404
01:01:40,870 --> 01:01:42,539
Seeing My Khe Beach and the Buddha statue together...

1405
01:01:42,540 --> 01:01:44,209
is a popular route.

1406
01:01:44,210 --> 01:01:45,910
(A must-do for travellers in Da Nang)

1407
01:01:46,340 --> 01:01:48,179
There sure are lots of Korean tourists here.

1408
01:01:48,180 --> 01:01:49,509
- I see a lot of Korean signs.
- Right?

1409
01:01:49,510 --> 01:01:50,580
Yes.

1410
01:01:50,880 --> 01:01:52,850
- Da Nang Seafood Paradise.
- Right.

1411
01:01:53,650 --> 01:01:54,820
It's written in Korean.

1412
01:01:54,980 --> 01:01:56,180
They're all written in Korean.

1413
01:01:56,550 --> 01:01:57,949
There are a lot of Koreans.

1414
01:01:57,950 --> 01:01:59,189
We won't be going there.

1415
01:01:59,190 --> 01:02:00,219
Right.

1416
01:02:00,220 --> 01:02:01,990
(The travel buddies must stick to their standard.)

1417
01:02:02,260 --> 01:02:06,960
(Mỳ Quảng, My Khe Beach, Sơn Trà)

1418
01:02:07,860 --> 01:02:08,960
There are a lot of people.

1419
01:02:09,930 --> 01:02:11,070
Are they all locals?

1420
01:02:23,340 --> 01:02:24,750
If you look around,

1421
01:02:25,380 --> 01:02:27,280
